[en.FOCUS_C12_UNEXPECTED_FRIEND]
An Unexpected Friend

[en.FOCUS_C12_UNEXPECTED_FRIEND_desc]
Maud Pie stumbled upon some mysterious sketches left behind, perhaps something her sister’s confidant, Cheese Sandwich, could decipher. She decided to extend an immediate invitation for him to visit the farm.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNEXPECTED_FRIEND]
意料之外的朋友

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNEXPECTED_FRIEND_desc]
石灰派找到了一些遗留下来的神秘的草稿，也许她妹妹的知心朋友，芝士三明治可以看得懂，应该立即邀请他来岩石农场

